{#- Day 30 after the due date. No legal threats: referral to collections is the strongest language
    used, and it is true (the 60-day handoff). -#}
{% extends "email/base.j2" %}
{% block subject %}Final reminder — Invoice {{ invoice_number }} ({{ days_past_due }} days past due){% endblock %}
{% block content %}Dear {{ contact_name | default(customer_name, true) }},

Despite earlier reminders, invoice {{ invoice_number }} remains unpaid
{{ days_past_due }} days after its due date of {{ due_date }}. The
outstanding balance is {{ balance }}.

Please treat this as our final reminder. If payment is not received, or we
do not hear from you regarding this invoice, the matter will be referred to
our collections team for direct follow-up.

If payment has been made in the last few days, kindly reply with the
transaction reference so we can reconcile it immediately.{% endblock %}
